OL,3,ASharp rise in sales of essential goods
OL,4,Aafter government call to stock up
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome major retailers have seen a
OL,7,Fdramatic increase in sales of essential
OL,8,Fgoods after the government called on
OL,9,Fthe nation to stock up in case of a
OL,10,Fcrisis, according to figures obtained
OL,11,Fby BBC Newsnight.
OL,13,FThe Iceland supermarket chain told the
OL,14,Fprogramme it was "clear" that consumers
OL,15,Fhad listened to warnings after it saw a
OL,16,F40% increase in sales of tinned
OL,17,Fproducts over the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
