OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASharp rise in sales of essential goods
OL,4,Aafter government call to stock up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rise in sales came after Defence
OL,7,FSecretary Wes Streeting said last week
OL,8,Fthat people should stockpile goods to
OL,9,Fbe prepared for an emergency such as a
OL,10,Fcyber attack or an extreme weather
OL,11,Fevent.
OL,13,FMany of the items cited by Streeting
OL,14,Fappeared in the list of goods gathered
OL,15,Fby Newsnight whose sales have shot up.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
